<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>OPTIONAL: Muscle Recruitment Progressions - Trainer</name>
  <description>Warm up with Z1/Z2 pedaling, then some efforts:

3x3min efforts ~low Z3 RPE with increasing cadence each min as follows:

60-70 &lt; 80-90 &lt; 100-110

2x5min efforts ~low Z3 RPE alternating one min seated / one min standing (in biggish gear, try and feel smooth and rhythmic)

6x30 sec @ 120+ rpm, no power just leg speed focus / 60 sec recovery

Cool down</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
